<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='7242067803581850414'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ICAIBD 2027: 2027 The 10th International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Big Data</div><div id="cfpvenue">Minshan Hotel</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Chengdu, China, May 28-30, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.icaibd.org/" target="_blank">https://www.icaibd.org/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icaibd2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icaibd2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>November 30, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=753432" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_bluelight bg_aqua">big data analytics</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=401" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_darkyellow">machine learning</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=3221" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_blue bg_darksalmon">computer vision</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=3188" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_gray1">pattern recognition</span></a></div><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">2027 The 10th International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Big Data (ICAIBD 2027) will take place on May 28-30, 2027 in Chengdu, China. It is sponsored by Sichuan Province Computer Federation and technically assisted by many local and international universities. This conference provides you opportunity to meet with academicians as well as practitioners in the fields of Artificial Intelligence and Big Data from all over the world, and get the latest insights from every area of Artificial Intelligence and Big Data theory and practice.</span></span></p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">1. All manuscripts must be written in English.<br/>2. The minimum page limit for all manuscripts is 4 full pages, and the maximum page limit is 12 pages. When it exceeds 6 pages, each additional page will be chargeable. These limits include all figures, tables, and references. All manuscripts must be formatted in conference proceedings – Letter paper size, two columns format.<br/>3. Manuscripts should state clearly and concisely the problem, methodology used and central conclusions, and may include figures and graphs.<br/>4. Manuscripts must include a bibliography to help reviewers place the contributions of the work into context.</span></span></p><h2>List of Topics</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">● Intelligent information systems<br/>● Intelligent data mining and farming<br/>● Intelligent web-based business<br/>● AI and evolutionary algorithms<br/>● Intelligent tutoring systems<br/>● Foundational Models for Big Data<br/>● Big Data Analytics and Metrics<br/>● Cloud Computing Techniques for Big Data<br/>● Big Data Persistence and Preservation<br/>● Big Data Quality and Provenance Control<br/>● Big Data Economics<br/>● Big Data for Business Model Innovation<br/>● Neural networks and applications<br/>● Learning and adaptive sensor fusion<br/>● Evaluation of AI tools<br/>● Emerging technologies<br/>● Brain models, Brain mapping, Cognitive science<br/>● Fuzzy logic and soft computing<br/>● Decision support systems<br/>● Management Issues of Social Network Big Data<br/>● Distributed, and Peer-to-peer Search<br/>● ...</span></span></p><h2>Committees</h2><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Honorary Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Zhang Jingzhong - Chinese Academy of Sciences</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">General Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Shi Zhiming - Chengdu Institute of Computer Applications, Chinese Academy of Sciences</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Zhou Jiliu - Chengdu University of Information Technology</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Program Committee Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Lv Jiancheng - Sichuan University</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Zhou Shijie - University of Electronic Science and Technology of China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Dai Yuanshun - Southwest Jiaotong University</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Zhong Yong - Sichuan Computer Federation</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Liu Zhong - Leshan Vocational and Technical College</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Publication Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Cynthia Miao, Sichuan Computer Federation, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Treasurer</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Huang Fumin - Chengdu University of Technology, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Local Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Qian Jide - Civil Aviation Flight University of China, China</span></span></p><h2>Invited Speakers</h2><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Speaker 1 Prof. Hongping Gan, Northwestern Polytechnical University, China</span></span></li></ul><h2>Publication</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Accepted papers will be submitted for publication into conference proceedings.</span></span></p><h2>Venue</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Minshan Hotel</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Address: No.55, Section 2, Renmin Road, Jinjiang District, Chengdu, Sichuan, 610016, China</span></span></p><h2>Contact</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Secretary: Ms. Joy Xu</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Email: icaibd@young.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Web: www.icaibd.org</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive">Tel: 86-28-87777577</span></span></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
